    "detailed_description": "<strong>Immerse Yourself in an Epic Turn-Based RPG Adventure! </strong><br><br>Welcome to Orendale, where strategy meets storytelling in a rich, immersive world. Embark on an unforgettable journey where your choices shape your destiny and the fate of the world. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985350/extras/de3846510e065d9dae1fe0724540e4a9.avif?t=1753379483\" width=609 height=68 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985350/extras/94a287ad3d9a594b5b5dbd60fbdc9982.poster.avif?t=1753379483\" width=608 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985350/extras/94a287ad3d9a594b5b5dbd60fbdc9982.webm?t=1753379483\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985350/extras/94a287ad3d9a594b5b5dbd60fbdc9982.mp4?t=1753379483\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Plan your moves carefully in tactical turn-based combat. Exploit enemy weaknesses, and master a variety of skills and abilities to emerge victorious.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985350/extras/91dacf0d724befc0f48c0133f1ccd390.avif?t=1753379483\" width=609 height=68 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985350/extras/ce1f9aec45a100146293a499a98b445c.poster.avif?t=1753379483\" width=608 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985350/extras/ce1f9aec45a100146293a499a98b445c.webm?t=1753379483\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985350/extras/ce1f9aec45a100146293a499a98b445c.mp4?t=1753379483\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Create your own unique hero. Choose from a variety of classes, each with its own strengths and weaknesses. Develop your skills and equip your character with powerful gear. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985350/extras/5bf67f31e421cc70771e6bddf8f10577.avif?t=1753379483\" width=609 height=68 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985350/extras/0e1f252760174571bf98c303b52a48a8.poster.avif?t=1753379483\" width=608 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985350/extras/0e1f252760174571bf98c303b52a48a8.webm?t=1753379483\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985350/extras/0e1f252760174571bf98c303b52a48a8.mp4?t=1753379483\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Gather resources and craft your own weapons, armor, and items. Tailor your equipment to your playstyle and discover rare equipment that gives you the edge in battle.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985350/extras/1c2da6ea922b505813a4dfe7cdc75441.avif?t=1753379483\" width=609 height=68 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985350/extras/2cefdcb7023b1aab1f9463a27a493b01.poster.avif?t=1753379483\" width=608 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985350/extras/2cefdcb7023b1aab1f9463a27a493b01.webm?t=1753379483\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985350/extras/2cefdcb7023b1aab1f9463a27a493b01.mp4?t=1753379483\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Face off against formidable foes in epic encounters. Study their patterns, adapt your strategies, and utilize your allies\u2019 unique abilities to defeat them. <br><br>Join the adventure today and shape your own legend in Orendale. Will you be the hero this world needs or the villain that destroys it? <br><br><i><strong>Wishlist and Follow for Updates: </strong><br>Stay up to date with the latest news, updates, and exclusive content. Add Orendale to your wishlist and follow us on Steam for more! </i><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985350/extras/5d275de82aef4202f6d559ab9b2fe41b.poster.avif?t=1753379483\" width=608 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985350/extras/5d275de82aef4202f6d559ab9b2fe41b.webm?t=1753379483\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985350/extras/5d275de82aef4202f6d559ab9b2fe41b.mp4?t=1753379483\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985350/extras/0cfbaa08f76a6116d12368d5089fd4af.avif?t=1753379483\" width=609 height=68 /></span>",
